 oo-ui-labelWidget'>French</label><div lang='fr' dir='ltr' class='wbmi-caption-value'>Big Buck Bunny - Un court métrage d&#039;animation créé par la &quot;Blender Foundation&quot;</div></div></div><div id="mw-imagepage-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Summary">Summary</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=File:Big_Buck_Bunny_4K.webm&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Summary"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
